ailable!","summary":"The newest demo for RalphGame is now available to play on the Steam page (for free, of course). It's not very long but it may be depending on your experience with the game through other demos so far.. You'll have to dive and dodge your way past armed enemies and escape the halls, which proves to be harder than it sounds. Give it a try and let me know if you come across any issues, please send me a crash log if it does happen to crash too :)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2022-05-31T15:38:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4437747060845077529","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2008670":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-23T22:26:12Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-23T22:26:12Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2008670":"2026-10-23T22:26:12Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2008670":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-23T22:26:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-23T22:26:12Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"2008940":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-23T22:26:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-23T22:26:12Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
